[Fiber Forward](https://fiberforward.com/)

[About Us](https://fiberforward.com/about-us/)

# About Us

Our team covers all aspects of fiber broadband deployment including network design & engineering, project management, construction, installation, operations, software, hardware and other information that empowers people to build fiber networks. The magazine and its staff have decades of combined experience in the fiber broadband industry, with regular commentary from industry leaders and practitioners across the entire spectrum of network build and operation.

## Our Mission

Fiber Forward is the premier media brand supporting the growth of fiber network services globally. Fiber Forward features news analysis and commentary on fiber network deployment related technologies, markets and companies. Our coverage includes:

- Network design & engineering
- Project management
- Construction & installation
- Network operations
- OSS/BSS
- Hardware & software related to fiber deployment
- Markets & policy

## Our Team

### Doug Mohney

Doug Mohney is the Editor in Chief of Fiber Forward magazine. Prior to the publication, he spent over three decades in reporting on technology industry including writing for computer magazines in the 1990s, covering VoIP and cloud telephony from 2001-2016, covering drone/UAS usage in commercial/professional services from 2016-2021, and fiber broadband since 2021. He also writes a geopolitical column for a separate publication.

